        <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-700/80 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950/80 p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300"><code>{`from pyspark.sql import SparkSession
