          <div><span class="text-amber-400 font-medium">输出 10%</span><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">写博客、画架构图、向别人讲清楚</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Checklist -->
    <section id="checklist" class="scroll-mt-24 mb-12">
      <div class="mb-5">
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-1">09 / CHECKLIST</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold">出师自测清单</h2>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-5">
        下面 10 项中至少能独立完成 7 项，再开始投递大数据实习或初级岗位。做不到的项，回到对应阶段补练。
      </p>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-700/60 bg-[var(--color-surface-1)] divide-y divide-slate-200/80 dark:divide-slate-700/80">
        {selfCheck.map((item, i) => (
          <label class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-900/[0.03] dark:hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors cursor-pointer">
            <input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 w-4 h-4 rounded border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 accent-emerald-600 shrink-0" />
            <span><span class="text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 font-mono text-xs mr-2">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>{item}</span>
          </label>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-600/20 dark:border-emerald-400/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/10 to-teal-500/5 p-6 sm:p-8 mb-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold mb-2">下一步：把路线变成每天的阅读</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-5">
        本站持续聚合美团技术团队、CSDN 大数据、JavaGuide、涛思数据等教程与实践型来源。
        建议按“本周主题”筛选文章，读完一篇就动手复现一次。
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href={withBase('/')} class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white text-sm font-medium transition-colors">
          浏览最新文章
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href={withBase('/sources')} class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-400 dark:hover:border-slate-500 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">
          查看全部来源
        </a>
        <a href={withBase('/categorie/big-data')} class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-400 dark:hover:border-slate-500 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">
          大数据生态
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
